# No native browser dialogs

Never use `window.alert`, `window.confirm`, or `window.prompt` in product UI.

Use **`AppConfirmDialog`** (reka-ui) for destructive or irreversible confirmations, matching existing patterns in project/asset/delete flows.

For non-blocking feedback, use inline messages, `AppCallout`, or toasts consistent with the page — not `alert()`.

If a third-party library triggers native dialogs, wrap or replace that path in app code.